menu "gpSP experiments"
    config GBSP_FAST_RAM_WRITES
        bool "Direct interpreter writes to IWRAM/EWRAM"
        default n
        help
            Experimental fast path for ordinary work RAM stores only.
            Keeps original cycle accounting and all non-RAM handlers.
            Ignored with dynarec/SMC. Compare on hardware before adopting.
    config GBSP_MEMORY_PROFILE
        bool "Count interpreter data accesses (diagnostic only)"
        default n
        help
            Count interpreter data reads/writes by region and width.
            Excludes instruction fetch, DMA, PPU and addresses >= 0x10000000.
            Writes window totals to gbsp-memory.txt. Adds hot-path overhead;
            do not compare its timings with normal builds. Ignored with dynarec.
endmenu
